==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|take<,,took,taken> after}}

# To [[resemble]] (a parent or ancestor) in [[appearance]] or [[habit]].
#: ''She '''takes after''' her grandmother with her wide eyes and quiet disposition.''
# To [[follow]] someone's [[example]].

